     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Dear nimble-users,<div>We don&#39;t use this list often for job postings that are not directly about nimble, but I want to share this widely.  Please pass along to anyone who you think might be interested.  Thanks.</div><div>Perry</div><div><br></div><div><br><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_attr\">---------- Forwarded message ---------<br>From: <strong class=\"gmail_sendername\" dir=\"auto\">Schmidt DSE</strong> <span dir=\"auto\">&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">d...@berkeley.edu</a>&gt;</span><br>Date: Tue, Dec 6, 2022 at 11:08 AM<br>Subject: We are Hiring! Help develop data-enabled solutions to our most pressing environmental challenges<br>To: Perry de Valpine &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">pdeva...@berkeley.edu</a>&gt;<br></div><br><br><div><u></u>\r\n\r\n    \r\n        \r\n        \r\n        \r\n        \r\n        \r\n        \r\n\r\n    \r\n    <div style=\"min-height:100%;margin:0;padding:0;width:100%;background-color:#fafafa\">\r\n        \r\n        <span style=\"display:none;font-size:0px;line-height:0px;max-height:0px;max-width:0px;opacity:0;overflow:hidden\">The Eric and Wendy Schmidt Center for Data Science &amp; Environment at Berkeley (DSE) has multiple openings for several new roles.</span>\r\n        \r\n        <center>\r\n            <table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" height=\"100%\" width=\"100%\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;height:100%;margin:0;padding:0;width:100%;background-color:#fafafa\">\r\n                <tbody><tr>\r\n                    <td align=\"center\" valign=\"top\" style=\"height:100%;margin:0;padding:10px;width:100%;border-top:0\">\r\n                        \r\n                        \r\n                        <table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;border:0;max-width:600px!important\">\r\n                            <tbody><tr>\r\n    