                            <tr>\r\n                                <td valign=\"top\" style=\"background:#ffffff none no-repeat center/cover;background-color:#ffffff;background-image:none;background-repeat:no-repeat;background-position:center;background-size:cover;border-top:0;border-bottom:2px solid #eaeaea;padding-top:0;padding-bottom:9px\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"min-width:100%;border-collapse:collapse\">\r\n    <tbody>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding-top:9px\">\r\n              \t\r\n\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\r\n                <table align=\"left\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"max-width:100%;min-width:100%;border-collapse:collapse\" width=\"100%\">\r\n                    <tbody><tr>\r\n\r\n                        <td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding-top:0;padding-right:18px;padding-bottom:9px;padding-left:18px;word-break:break-word;color:#202020;font-family:Helvetica;font-size:16px;line-height:150%;text-align:left\">\r\n\r\n                            <p style=\"margin:10px 0;padding:0;color:#202020;font-family:Helvetica;font-size:16px;line-height:150%;text-align:left\">The Eric and Wendy Schmidt Center for Data Science &amp; Environment at Berkeley (<a href=\"https://berkeley.us20.list-manage.com/track/click?u=c97900b1236be4ecb4a31f22c&amp;id=a29f13230c&amp;e=e0e52e82e0\" style=\"color:#007c89;font-weight:normal;text-decoration:underline\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://berkeley.us20.list-manage.com/track/click?u%3Dc97900b1236be4ecb4a31f22c%26id%3Da29f13230c%26e%3De0e52e82e0&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792476547071000&amp;usg=AOvVaw05QlgyNFz3SDFMUjl5BZy3\">DSE</a>) has multiple openings for several new roles:<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"https://berkeley.us20.list-manage.com/track/click?u=c97900b1236be4ecb4a31f22c&amp;id=b7cb4a231e&amp;e=e0e52e82e0\" style=\"color:#007c89;font-weight:normal;text-decoration:underline\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://berkeley.us20.list-manage.com/track/click?u%3Dc97900b1236be4ecb4a31f22c%26id%3Db7cb4a231e%26e%3De0e52e82e0&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792476547071000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0zfJMeGGWrTioXewFWDY5J\">Program Manager</a><br>\r\n<a href=\"https://berkeley.us20.list-manage.com/track/click?u=c97900b1236be4ecb4a31f22c&amp;id=73ce256e26&amp;e=e0e52e82e0\" style=\"color:#007c89;font-weight:normal;text-decoration:underline\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://berkeley.us20.list-manage.com/track/click?u%3Dc97900b1236be4ecb4a31f22c%26id%3D73ce256e26%26e%3De0e52e82e0&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792476547071000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3F67Qzs_ZoIb13n_Mkz-6E\">Data Scientist / Research Software Engineer</a><br>\r\n<a href=\"https://berkeley.us20.list-manage.com/track/click?u=c97900b1236be4ecb4a31f22c&amp;id=135625b084&amp;e=e0e52e82e0\" style=\"color:#007c89;font-weight:normal;text-decoration:underline\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://berkeley.us20.list-manage.com/track/click?u%3Dc97900b1236be4ecb4a31f22c%26id%3D135625b084%26e%3De0e52e82e0&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792476547071000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0HsbNyY6GiIhDCBWAlVj0V\">Senior Data Scientist / Research Software Engineer</a><br>\r\n<br>\r\nWork with dynamic interdisciplinary teams bringing expertise in data science, software engineering, environmental science, and design while also being a part of the engaging UC Berkeley campus community, revolutionizing understanding across all fields.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nThe DSE combines the power of computing and environmental science with open science principles and a commitment to inclusivity—all towards the purpose of building tangible, replicable, and accessible solutions to problems compromising the health of our environment.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nThis is an exciting opportunity to get in on the ground floor of the new center and play a critical role in determining the direction and development of our activities.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nAbility to work at our collaborative space on UC Berkeley campus, with flexibility in timing is preferred; however, fully-remote candidates will also be considered.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nPlease share widely!<br>\r\nFor any questions, reach out to <a href style=\"color:#007c89;font-weight:normal;text-decoration:underline\" data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">d...@berkeley.edu</a>.</p>\r\n\r\n                        </td>\r\n                    </tr>\r\n                </tbody></table>\r\n\t\t\t\t\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\r\n            </td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n    </tbody>\r\n</table></td>\r\n                            </tr>\r\n                            <tr>\r\n                                <td valign=\"top\" style=\"background:#fafafa none no-repeat center/cover;background-color:#fafafa;background-image:none;background-repeat:no-repeat;background-position:center;background-size:cover;border-top:0;border-bottom:0;padding-top:9px;padding-bottom:9px\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"min-width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;table-layout:fixed!important\">\r\n    <tbody>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td style=\"min-width:100%;padding:10px 18px 25px\">\r\n                <table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"min-width:100%;border-top:2px solid #eeeeee;border-collapse:collapse\">\r\n                    <tbody><tr>\r\n                        <td>\r\n                            <span></span>\r\n                        </td>\r\n                    </tr>\r\n                </tbody></table>\r\n\r\n            </td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n    </tbody>\r\n</table><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"min-width:100%;border-collapse:collapse\">\r\n    <tbody>\r\n        <tr>